*.dll

# Local worlds and user data
/run/
/saves/

# Capture working directory: the PPMs each round's fixtures write, the PNGs
# they are converted to, and the little converter itself. Tens of megabytes a
# round, regenerable from the `--` flags README documents, and never part of
# the tree — this is the line that says so out loud.
/scratchpad/
